@startuml C4-Dynamic-Post-Create-Feed
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false

title Dynamic — Create post → JPA → fan-out → get post

actor "用户" as user
participant "Web / Mobile" as ui <<ui>>
participant "PostController" as postCtrl <<java>>
participant "PostService" as postSvc <<java>>
participant "SocialPostRepository" as postRepo <<java>>
participant "FeedFanoutService" as fanout <<java>>
database "H2 / Postgres\nJPA" as db <<db>>

== 发帖 ==
user -> ui : 创建帖子
ui -> postCtrl : POST /api/v1/posts (+ JWT)
postCtrl -> postSvc : createPost
postSvc -> postRepo : save(SocialPost)
postRepo -> db : INSERT social_posts
postSvc -> fanout : fanoutPostCreated
fanout -> db : UPSERT feed_entries\n(author + followers)
fanout -> fanout : invalidate feed cache (memory)
postSvc --> postCtrl : postId
postCtrl --> ui : 201

== 再读 ==
ui -> postCtrl : GET /api/v1/posts/{postId}
postCtrl -> postSvc : getPost
postSvc -> postRepo : findById
postRepo -> db : SELECT social_posts
db --> ui : 200 SocialPost

note over postSvc, db
  create 与 get 同一 JPA 数据源
  （本地 H2 或 Postgres）。
end note

@enduml
